//   1. MXR=1: MPRV ld, sd and amoadd.d (Zaamo) with MPP = S and U of page A tagged in the top 7
//     bits and in bits 63:48: not masked (access fault). MPP = M: masked per mseccfg.PMM.
//   2. MXR=0: MPP = S and U are masked again.
//
// Approximate dynamic instruction count: 7833
//

